/experiments/prayers/*  https://orthodoxprayers.net/:splat  301

# BitTorrent webseed (BEP 19). A multi-file torrent's webseed URL is built as
# <url-list><name>/<path>, so a client fetching this site's torrent asks for
# /tbm/index.html, /tbm/favicon/favicon.ico and so on. The site is served at the
# root, so map that prefix back onto it. 200, not 301: a redirect would work for
# a browser but several clients treat a 3xx on a webseed as a failed range
# request and drop the seed. Nothing else links these paths; robots.txt keeps
# them out of the index so they cannot read as duplicate content.
/tbm/*  /:splat  200
